    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Peter Wong",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106975743923978190037/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI91Iz5y_F5YnwxKSUKvMVrklbpNnJ-A9qVbwxuNKyS5N2SQw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I was specifically looking for a local sport therapist which offered not only private one on one session but also group classes for when I felt ready to ensure that the therapist could monitor and correct my deficiencies when attending the group classes.\n\nFor the last 18 months, I was experiencing random issues with my body but mostly having trouble with my right knee and lower back. Louis tailored a full body program focusing on strength building which we did him and I for roughly 2 month (typically 2 sessions/wk). I am happy to report that, despite my sporadic attendance, I see a huge improvement in my knee and mobility, especially when playing sports. I have recently migrated to group classes but plan on securing a few more individual sessions in the future to ensure that they can correct any bad habits I may have picked up when training individually. Louis always remained flexible to my availabilities and even proactively reached out to keep me accountable for our sessions which in turn, has really sparked my motivation.\n\nHighly recommended and most definitely worth the investment if you are experiencing nagging and recurring injuries when you are training/playing sports.",
        "time": 1734884780,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "robocraft _YT",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113525652333771869999/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWH-3Ple4fPU-TBHo9NU8qx-YwINgXw7MZOtk0KkO1D-q8YTZ0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Exceptional Personal Trainer - Highly Recommended!\nI cannot say enough great things about Louis-François Milot. From the very first session, he made me feel comfortable, motivated and confident in my fitness journey. His expertise and personalized approach have made a difference in my health, strength and overall well-being. He takes the time to understand my goals and creates tailored workouts that are challenging, yet achievable, which is very motivating. It was time I started investing in my health, and I am grateful that I found Louis-François to help me through this journey. I've already lost 15 lbs in the last 5 months while putting on a substantial amount of muscle mass, and I haven't changed anything in my diet up to now. I highly recommend Louis-François.\n\nThank you Louis!\nHari Lagogiannis",
        "time": 1737572324,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mark",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113261764176234377884/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKfRGsFJGzaqrgvk4q3sVuX1MhGsmcKnEOpS630YGsgIDloSg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Amazing results. After 3 months and 24 sessions of training with Louis-François, I saw muscle gains and lowered my body fat %.  I started off in good enough shape, but even people around me saw the changes.  Can’t say enough good things about his training programs!!",
        "time": 1742935260,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Casey Gray",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115670559968937091964/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLgfFlPPhH6vo9l9uxwsjDz-aIIjfNduUWZGKYl2hcutO-dzg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Can’t say enough about how amazing it is to train with Louis-François . He keeps me motivated with great programs and is very encouraging! I’m hitting all the goals I wanted when I first started . If you’re looking for truly knowledgeable professional, he’s the right trainer for you .",
        "time": 1713397953,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Noel Assi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110706255854126356127/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVGLPmovXo4s-qn0RiA1P7XSWPF5C1B4MLJO198zQdm6cTZzdQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I've had two other trainers before, for longer periods than I've already had with Louis. The results I've achieved with Louis in such a short time are more than satisfactory. He creates a program specifically tailored to his clients' goals and takes the time to listen to their needs. He's very attentive to detail and techniques to prevent injuries. The atmosphere is pleasant, and he has a good sense of humor. I highly recommend him to anyone looking for results that meet their specific needs.",
